"PHYS {#} · Virtual Physics Demos",
"<b>Electricity and magnetism, lecture by lecture</b>",
"Charge, fields and Gauss’s law, potential, capacitors, current and circuits, and magnetism, in the order of the PHYS {#} lectures, then the rest of the course in the order of the syllabus: sources of magnetic fields, induction, AC circuits, Maxwell’s equations, and optics. The worksheets are the Physics II worksheets, written for a calculus based class. OpenStax University Physics Volume {#}, and Volume {#} for optics.",
